  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 7.6.5\n* Updated DotPrimitives from 2.0.0 to 3.3.0\n* Updated DotPrimitives.Collections from 2.1.0 to 3.3.0\n\n### Breaking Changes\n* Removed ``FlexibleKeyValuePair`` extension methods as they have been moved to DotPrimitives.Collections directly and conflicted with newer DotPrimitives.Collections versions\n* Removed Process ``WaitForExitAsync`` overloads with ProcessTimeoutPolicy support and ProcessCancellationMode support - This was needed since DotPrimitives no longer contains those Primitives from version 3 onwards\n\n**NOTE**: Final intended update for DotExtensions version 7.",
